# A hole in the ceiling: air leaves, the ledger accounts for it, and the hull takes the reaction.
new sealed 20 14
breach 10 0
run 60

# Something must have left...
expect vented > 0
# ...and the solve must not be dumping impulse it could not place. Undelivered climbing is the
# tell that the discretisation is being outrun, so it is asserted rather than merely printed.
expect undelivered == 0

field pressure
state
